-That's a segment.
-That's a segment.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:32.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a segment.
-That's a segment.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was so exciting.
